### =========================================================
### ACTIVITY-HISTORY-CONTROLLER
### Cubre: GET /api/v1/history
### =========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = viajero.test@xplorenow.com
@password = Password123

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### -----------------------------------------------------
### 1. Historial completo (sin filtros)
### -----------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.b Filtro por rango de fechas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history?fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-06-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.c Filtro por destino
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history?destination=Bariloche
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.d Filtro combinado: destino + rango de fechas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history?fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-12-31&destination=Mendoza
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.e Rango de fechas sin resultados (fechas futuras lejanas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history?fromDate=2030-01-01&toDate=2030-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.f Sin token (debería devolver 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history
